# tests/fmt (tests/run-dos): NAME STATUS PROGRAM [ARGUMENTS]
#
# fmt FILE [all] runs a data file (made by gen) through sprintf, vsprintf,
# snprintf and vsnprintf, every line with a different one in turn, or all four
# with `all`. See README.txt.

